scenario network lost after a good boot: a new night uses the dated cache (TP7 without a power cycle)
boot                           # the live answer's Date header sets the clock and dates the cache
within 9 state == DARK_IDLE
expect source == LIVE
expect clock == 1
net down
press night
within 5.1 source == CACHED
within 9 state == DARK_IDLE
expect sky_c == 0.958
